  Slug: school-of-civic-wizardry
  DisplayName: School of Civic Wizardry
  IconPath: icons/sundries/books/book-embossed-steel-brown.webp
  Description: "Whether you studied in Manaket's Occularium or the Academy of Applied
    Magic, you learned that the fruits of arcane studies\u2014like any other field\u2014should
    ultimately help the common citizen. You've learned the humble art of construction,
    of finding lost people and things, of moving speedily among buildings and moats\u2014yet
    these same arts can be turned to demolition, and the constructs you animate to
    build bridges can just as easily tear them down. Curriculum cantrips: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Prestidigitation],
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Read Aura] 1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Hydraulic
    Push], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Pummeling Rubble], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Summon
    Construct] 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Revealing Light], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Water
    Walk] 3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Cozy Cabin], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Safe
    Passage] 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Creation], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Unfettered
    Movement] 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Control Water], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall
    of Stone] 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Disintegrate], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall
    of Force] 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Planar Palace], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Retrocognition]
    8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Earthquake], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Pinpoint]
    9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Foresight] School Spells initial:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Earthworks]; advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Community
    Restoration]"
